Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:48:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?get=5Fstats64:=20=E6=8E=A5=E5=8F=A3=20DOWN?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E6=97=B6=E4=B8=8D=E5=86=8D=E8=AF=BB=20tally=20counter?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

飞牛 r8127.ko 的 get_stats64 在 test_bit(R8127_FLAG_DOWN) 为 0 时才调用
rtl8127_dump_tally_counter, 官方 r8127 无此判断(从 .ko 反汇编还原, 多 4 条指令)。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/r8127_n.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/r8127_n.c b/src/r8127_n.c
index a15b8aa..eabee81 100755
--- a/src/r8127_n.c
+++ b/src/r8127_n.c
@@ -14010,7 +14010,8 @@ rtl8127_get_stats64(struct net_device *dev, struct rtnl_link_stats64 *stats)
          * Fetch additional counter values missing in stats collected by driver
          * from tally counters.
          */
-        rtl8127_dump_tally_counter(tp, paddr);
+        if (!test_bit(R8127_FLAG_DOWN, tp->task_flags))
+                rtl8127_dump_tally_counter(tp, paddr);
 
         stats->tx_errors = le64_to_cpu(counters->tx_errors);
         stats->collisions = le32_to_cpu(counters->tx_multi_collision);
